  "question": {
    "text": "From a variable point <math><mi>P</mi></math> on the tangent at the vertex of the parabola <math><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo></math> a line is drawn perpendicular to the chord of contact. These variable lines always pass through a fixed point, whose <math><mi>x</mi></math>-coordinate is",
    "image": null
  },
