  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Comparing the given parabola with&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></math>, we get&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math><br />Equation of the chord of contact of <math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></math><br />i.e.&nbsp;<math><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi></mi><mi></mi><mi></mi><mi></mi><mi></mi><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />A line perpendicular to it is&nbsp;<math><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi></math>&nbsp;</p><p>Since it passes through <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mi>&#955;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />Passes through <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> i.e.&nbsp;<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p>",
